# JOURNEY · the Deep: take the new game's three fish into a fight, bite once, leave, and find the dive waiting.
# Who acts first and what the enemies do is random, so the journey waits out the beats and expects only what every fight shows.

run /dungeon
expect The Shallows
expect ESC leave
tick 900
expect Bite
expect ENTER select
snap a fish chooses what to do
key enter
expect ←→ target
expect ENTER confirm
snap the bite picks its target
key enter
tick 900
expect Bite
snap the bite has landed and the next fish chooses
key esc
absent The Shallows
run /dungeon
expect The Shallows
expect Bite
snap the dive was waiting where it was left
